flowchart TB
  subgraph SFT["sft-pipeline: prompt curation and teacher responses"]
    P[Public/local prompts] --> S1[Stage 1: collect and exact dedup]
    D[Custom documents] --> S2[Stage 2: generate and ground questions]
    S1 --> DC[Configured benchmark decontamination]
    S2 --> DC
    DC --> S3[Stage 3: embed, cluster, annotate]
    S3 --> S4[Stage 4: quota selection; optional semantic dedup default off]
    S4 --> S5[Stage 5: teacher inference]
    S5 --> S6[Stage 6: structural checks, code checks, sampled judge]
    S6 --> O1[Final SFT JSONL]
    S2 -. evidence .-> A[Audit artifacts]
    S6 -. decisions .-> A
  end
  subgraph LC["lc-pipeline: separate generators for long-context skills"]
    T[Synthetic task definitions] --> R[RULER++: deterministic answers]
    C[Quality-filtered corpus] --> CP[Paragraph and passage construction]
    C --> CL[Embedding clusters]
    CL --> U[Untie: clustered source]
    CP --> U2[Untie: single source]
    CP --> M[MRCR and IDK]
    C --> Q[QA: sample chunks; prepare requests]
    C --> S[Summary: whole-document requests]
    Q --> I[Built-in API or external inference]
    S --> I
    I --> AS[Strict response import and assembly]
    R --> O2[Per-generator PT or SFT records]
    U --> O2
    U2 --> O2
    M --> O2
    AS --> O2
  end
